<title>ITALY: Italian retail sales rose 4.5 pct in June yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italian retail sales rose 4.5 pct in June yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail sales of medium and large firms in Italy rose 4.5 percent year-on-year in June, national statistics institute ISTAT said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the retail sales index (1990-100) was 136.1 in June against 130.2 in the same 1995 month.</p>
<p>Retail sales in the first six months of 1996 rose 6.4 percent compared with the same period last year.</p>
<p>--Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
